WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.720
The farmer frowned at Jeremy.

2
00:00:06.721 --> 00:00:09.844
"Let me go!" Jeremy said.

3
00:00:09.845 --> 00:00:13.859
"I'll get rid of you!" the farmer said.

4
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:18.088
He lifted Jeremy into the air.

5
00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:22.428
"Oh no!" Jeremy gulped.

6
00:00:22.429 --> 00:00:25.471
The farmer was going to throw him!

7
00:00:25.472 --> 00:00:29.841
Suddenly the farmer's line jerked.

8
00:00:29.842 --> 00:00:32.677
"A fish!" the farmer cried.

9
00:00:32.678 --> 00:00:36.340
He dropped Jeremy.

10
00:00:36.341 --> 00:00:41.200
Jeremy hopped away as fast as he could.

11
00:00:41.201 --> 00:00:46.210
He hid under a bush.

12
00:00:46.211 --> 00:00:50.497
"Today is not a good fishing day," Jeremy thought.

13
00:00:50.498 --> 00:00:53.741
"I will just eat flies for supper."

14
00:00:53.742 --> 00:01:05.214
The farmer pulled in his line.

15
00:01:05.215 --> 00:01:07.523
He looked at the hook.

16
00:01:07.524 --> 00:01:11.615
"This is a tiny minnow!" he yelled.

17
00:01:11.616 --> 00:01:16.839
"I want a big fish!"

18
00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:20.491
The farmer tossed the minnow.

19
00:01:20.492 --> 00:01:21.233
Thump!

20
00:01:21.234 --> 00:01:23.815
Something landed under the bush.

21
00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:28.756
"Wow!" Jeremy said. "A minnow!"

22
00:01:28.757 --> 00:01:39.375
He hopped home fast.

23
00:01:39.376 --> 00:01:42.783
Soon Jeremy was very full.

24
00:01:42.784 --> 00:01:56.925
"What a yummy supper!" he said.

